                <!-- Itinerary Timeline -->
                <div class="form-card" style="padding: 2rem;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Day-by-Day Itinerary</h3>
                    
                    <div class="itinerary-timeline">
                        
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-day">Day 1 &middot; Dec 15</span>
                                <h4>Arrival in Rovaniemi & Glass Igloo Check-in</h4>
                                <p>Arrive at Rovaniemi airport where our driver will be waiting. Transfer directly to the Arctic SnowHotel & Glass Igloos. Settle into your 360-degree glass igloo and enjoy a welcome dinner featuring traditional Lappish cuisine.</p>
                                <div class="timeline-meta">
                                    <span><i class="ph-bold ph-bed"></i> Arctic SnowHotel & Glass Igloos</span>
                                    <span><i class="ph-bold ph-fork-knife"></i> Dinner included</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-day">Day 2 &middot; Dec 16</span>
                                <h4>Husky Safari & Northern Lights Hunt</h4>
                                <p>After breakfast, head to a local husky farm. Learn how to mush your own team of enthusiastic huskies through the snow-covered forests. In the evening, join an expert guide for a Northern Lights hunting expedition by snowmobile away from city lights.</p>
                                <div class="timeline-meta">
                                    <span><i class="ph-bold ph-clock"></i> 6 Hours total activities</span>
                                    <span><i class="ph-bold ph-fork-knife"></i> Breakfast & Campfire snacks included</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-day">Day 3 &middot; Dec 17</span>
                                <h4>Reindeer Farm Visit & Santa Claus Village</h4>
                                <p>Meet traditional reindeer herders and enjoy a peaceful sleigh ride. Afterwards, cross the magical Arctic Circle at Santa Claus Village. Meet Santa, send postcards from his official post office, and enjoy free time for shopping.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-dot end"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-day">Day 4 &middot; Dec 18</span>
                                <h4>Departure</h4>
                                <p>Enjoy a final Nordic breakfast before your private transfer takes you back to Rovaniemi Airport for your onward journey.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
